    },
    "Copies at true size with cut marks, to print at a pharmacy or photo kiosk. Saved to Photos next to the photo." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按实际尺寸排版并带裁切线，可在冲印店或自助冲印机打印。与照片一起存入“照片”App。"
