    "Drag to move, pinch to zoom, double-tap for the automatic crop." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖移以移动，双指捏合以缩放，连按两下以自动裁剪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "e-Visa" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电子签证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enjoying PassPhoto? A tip is appreciated." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "喜欢 PassPhoto 吗？欢迎打赏支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Even light on the face, no shadows or flash glare." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "脸部光线均匀，无阴影或闪光灯反光。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Even, with no shadows on the face." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光线均匀，脸上无阴影。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every requirement is re-checked against its official page each quarter, and PassPhoto downloads updates on its own. Each document links to its official page and shows when it was last confirmed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每项规定每季度都会对照官方页面重新核查，PassPhoto 会自动下载更新。每种证件都附有官方页面链接，并显示上次确认的日期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everywhere else" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其他地区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eye height" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "眼睛高度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eyes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "眼睛"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eyes from bottom edge" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "眼睛距底边"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eyes open" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "睁眼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eyes open and looking straight at the camera, with hair away from your eyes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "睁开双眼，直视镜头，头发不要遮住眼睛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eyes open if possible; a baby’s eyes may be closed. Look straight at the camera." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "尽量睁开眼睛（婴儿可以闭眼），直视镜头。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Face soft, even light, like a window in front of you. No shadows on your face or the wall, and no flash." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面向柔和均匀的光线，例如面前的窗户。脸上和墙上都不要有阴影，也不要使用闪光灯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Face width" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "脸部宽度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Faces, crops and backgrounds are measured on this iPhone. Only the quality check goes to Apple’s Private Cloud Compute, which processes the photo privately and doesn’t keep it. Nothing is sent to PassPhoto or anyone else." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "人脸、裁剪和背景都在这台 iPhone 上测量。只有质量检查会交给 Apple 的私密云计算，它以私密方式处理照片且不会保留。任何内容都不会发送给 PassPhoto 或其他任何人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Facing the camera" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正对镜头"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find more light" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请到光线更充足的地方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finding your face…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
